<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine coconut products average weekly prices.</title>
<headline>Philippine coconut products average weekly prices.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are average weekly prices for Philippine coconut products. The prices are based on trades carried out through the United Coconut Associations of the Philippines.</p>
<p>International prices (dollars per tonne CIF Europe)</p>
<p>		  (October/November shipments)</p>
<p>			     Oct 5	    Sept 28</p>
<p>COCONUT OIL</p>
<p>    Sellers		732.75	    730</p>
<p>    Buyers		 722.25	    721.50</p>
<p>    Traded		 729.25	    729.00</p>
<p>COPRA</p>
<p>    Sellers		none		 none</p>
<p>    Buyers		 none		 none</p>
